# Shell scripts must keep LF endings regardless of the checking-out
# platform's core.autocrlf — a CRLF-corrupted script fails to parse under
# bash (e.g. "set -euo pipefail\r" -> "invalid option name"). Windows
# checkouts of this repo are common (card-studio itself is often worked on
# natively on Windows even though it deploys into a WSL-hosted
# moxproxies-website) — see scripts/deploy-to-moxproxies.sh.
*.sh text eol=lf
